# Whitelist mode: ignore everything by default, explicitly allow tracked files.
# This prevents accidental commit of runtime files, secrets, and generated data.

# Ignore everything
*

# Allow directories (must end with / to match directories only)
!.gitignore
!README.md
!go.mod
!go.sum
!main.go
!system_alert.go
!file_delivery.go
!file_delivery_test.go
!file_intake.go
!file_intake_test.go
!scripts/
!scripts/verify_large_file.go
!scripts/loggrep.py
!scripts/doc_snapshot.py
!scripts/trajectory-pack.sh
!run.sh
!tagent.yaml
!tagent.rl.yaml
!exec_tool_desc.md
!train_tagent.py
!train_rl_config.yaml

# Container assets (env-injected secrets only, no hardcoded credentials)
!Dockerfile
!docker-compose.yml
!entrypoint.sh

# Manual hot-swap executor (2026-09-11: gained NOTICE staging + insurance
# handshake; still the active manual-restart path, must be versioned)
!restart-tagent.sh
!restart-maintenance.sh

# 裸机 systemd 部署资产(unit 模板 + 部署指南;不含密钥,可安全入库)
!deploy/
!deploy/tagent-wechat.service
!deploy/README.md

# 本地部署向导 + 环境变量模板（wizard 生成 .env；.env 本身因上方白名单模式天然被忽略，
# 绝不含 !.env 放行——只放行不含密钥的 .example 模板与向导脚本）
!wizard.sh
!.env.example

# Allow prompt resources (USER.md is personal context, never tracked)
!resources/
!resources/prompts/
!resources/prompts/*.md
resources/prompts/USER.md

# Allow skills: whole dirs tracked (whitelist mode), runtime node_modules excluded.
# NOTE: gitignore semantics — a negation cannot resurrect files under a directory
# that was already excluded, so every tracked skill dir must be named explicitly
# (see tracked-hygiene lint); !skills/*/** alone does NOT cover second-level dirs.
!skills/
!skills/agent-mail-send/
!skills/agent-mail-send/**
!skills/audio-separation-pipeline/
!skills/audio-separation-pipeline/**
!skills/go-service-ops/
!skills/go-service-ops/**
!skills/gopls-code-nav/
!skills/gopls-code-nav/**
!skills/ima/
!skills/ima/**
!skills/interview/
!skills/interview/**
skills/*/node_modules/

# Re-ignore all dotfiles and dot-directories (runtime data)
.wechat-config/
.wechat-context-tokens/
.weixin-token.json
.tagent-output/
workspace/
data/
logs/
*.log
wechat-bot
.wechat-config/
.wechat-context-tokens/
.weixin-token.json
logs/
*.log
wechat-bot
data/
openspec/
!dedup.go
!dedup_test.go

# ---- mail-poller (openspec: agentmail-email-inbound-channel) ----
# 白名单制补充: 拉取器代码/文档/部署单元入库; .env 与 data/ 运行态保持忽略
!mail-poller/
!mail-poller/mail_poller.py
!mail-poller/README.md
!mail-poller/.env.example
!deploy/tagent-mail-poller.service
!docs/
!docs/notes/
!docs/notes/mail-poller-notes.md
# Tracked source that the whitelist must name explicitly (tracked ⇒ must not be ignored).
!skills/
!skills/url-fetcher/
!reincarnation_notice.go
!reincarnation_notice_test.go
!delivery_receipt.go
!delivery_receipt_test.go
!skills/README.md
!skills/url-fetcher/README.md
!skills/url-fetcher/TESTING.md
!skills/url-fetcher/UPGRADE.md
!skills/url-fetcher/extract_content.js
!skills/url-fetcher/fetch_wechat.js
!skills/url-fetcher/package-lock.json
!skills/url-fetcher/package.json
!skills/url-fetcher/skill.md
!skills/url-fetcher/smart_fetcher.js
!skills/url-fetcher/url_fetcher.js
